.TH BNLEARN 1 2000-1月 "prior_network" "prior_network"
.SH NAME
prior_network \- create prior knowledge netwoek edges from the given vector data
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIprior_network(\fBTF\fR as any, 
\fBtarget_gene\fR as any, 
\fBregulation_type\fR as any, 
\fBconfidence\fR as any, 
\fBevidence\fR as any);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
create prior knowledge netwoek edges from the given vector data
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBTF\fB \fR\- 
 a character vector of the transcript factor protein/rna id of each 
 regulatory edge.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtarget_gene\fB \fR\- 
 a character vector of the target gene id of each regulatory edge.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBregulation_type\fB \fR\- 
 a character vector of the regulation type of each regulatory edge, the 
 value could be \fBUnknown\fR, \fBActivator\fR or \fBInhibitor\fR.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBconfidence\fB \fR\- 
 a numeric vector of the confidence score of each regulatory edge, which 
 should be a value in the range \fB[0,1]\fR.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBevidence\fB \fR\- 
 a character vector of the evidence source description of each regulatory 
 edge.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a vector of the @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.BNLearn.Core.RegulatoryEdge\fR regulatory edge data, all of 
 the input vectors should be in the same size as the input TF vector, this 
 generated edge collection can be used as the whitelist of the network 
 structure learning via the \fBbnlearn\fR api, or be converted to a 
 @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.BNLearn.Core.PriorNetwork\fR object via the \fBas.prior_net\fR api.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
bnlearn
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
